sts{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T20:27:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T20:27:06Z","body":"Let's approve this simple fix before Godot 4.7 is released.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4625828907/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5299590614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115939#issuecomment-5299590614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115939","id":5299590614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO-FV1g","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-15T00:45:22Z","updated_at":"2026-08-15T00:58:16Z","body":"`-1` means that no bones have been assigned yet.\r\n\r\nFor bone_id, the PhysicalBone attached to the actual bone is designed to search for the original skeleton by its name through an update. The simulator copies and syncs it for iteration. I think the root cause of the `-1` occurrence is an issue with the timing of either the update or the sync.\r\n\r\nSince `-1` is assigned when creating a PhysicalBone3D, it makes sense that it should be ignored. I think it is fine to ignore it at the time of creation, that is, when assigned bone name is empty.\r\n\r\nMy slight concern is whether issues might occur in cases other than creation, such as during reparenting, and hiding errors if problems do arise is not a good way. If so I think this fix just hides the error and doesn't actually solve the problem with the update timing. As mentioned in Comment https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122053#issuecomment-5230451711, we might need to implement dirty management.\r\n\r\nSo, before committing this PR, check the current `master` branch to see if this error occurs at any other points besides during generation; if it doesn't, then this PR should be fine","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5299590614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]